@startuml 图7-类图
title 图 7　类图：核心领域模型（节选，字段已简化）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "组织与权限" {
  class User {
    - userId : Long
    - username : String
    - role : String
    - departmentId : Long
    - employeeNo : String
  }
  class Department {
    - departmentId : Long
    - parentId : Long
    - deptCode : String
    - leaderId : Long
  }
  class Role {
    - roleKey : String
    - roleName : String
    - dataScope : ALL/DEPT/SELF
  }
  class Permission {
    - permKey : String
    - permName : String
    - module : String
  }
  class RolePermission {
    - roleKey : String
    - permKey : String
  }
}

package "协作域" {
  class Team {
    - teamId : Long
    - teamName : String
    - leaderId : Long
  }
  class TeamMember {
    - teamId : Long
    - userId : Long
    - teamRole : leader/member
  }
  class Schedule {
    - scheduleId : Long
    - creatorId : Long
    - teamId : Long
    - startTime : Date
  }
  class Kanban {
    - kanbanId : Long
    - teamId : Long
    - creatorId : Long
  }
  class Worklog {
    - worklogId : Long
    - creatorId : Long
    - content : Text
  }
  class Comment {
    - commentId : Long
    - creatorId : Long
    - relatedType : String
    - relatedId : Long
    - content : Text
  }
}

package "考勤域" {
  class IotDevice {
    - deviceSn : String
    - secret : String(64hex)
    - status : active/DISABLED
  }
  class AttendanceRecord {
    - recordId : Long
    - userId : Long
    - deviceSn : String
    - punchTime : DateTime
    - messageId : String(UK)
  }
  class AttendanceDaily {
    - userId : Long
    - workDate : Date
    - status : NORMAL/LATE/…
  }
  class MakeupRequest {
    - requestId : Long
    - userId : Long
    - status : pending/approved
    - approverId : Long
  }
}

package "审计" {
  class AuditLog {
    - auditId : Long
    - operatorId : Long
    - module : String
    - action : String
    - result : SUCCESS/FAILURE
    - traceId : String
  }
}

Department "1" --> "N" User : 归属
User "N" --> "1" Role : 岗位
Role "1" --> "N" RolePermission
Permission "1" --> "N" RolePermission
Team "1" --> "N" TeamMember : 成员
TeamMember "N" --> "1" User
IotDevice "1" --> "N" AttendanceRecord : 上报
AttendanceRecord "N" --> "1" User
AttendanceDaily "1" --> "N" AttendanceRecord : 汇总
MakeupRequest "N" --> "1" AttendanceRecord : 审批通过→写记录
AuditLog ..> User : 操作留痕
Schedule "1" --> "N" Comment : 评论
Worklog "1" --> "N" Comment : 评论

note bottom
  全库无物理外键，上面所有连线都是「逻辑关联」（见数据库设计说明书第 6 章）。
  唯一索引承担业务约束：attendance_record(message_id)、(employee_no, punch_time)。
end note
@enduml
